E T 0~
elf rogue Christmas~
the &08rogue&00 Christmas elf~
&00&06A disgruntled Christmas elf is hiding in the shadows.&00
~
   Elves, as a race, are generally quite beautiful.  And, as with all rules,
there are exceptions.  This elf is one of them.  He stands four feet tall, with
a nose perfectly in proportion to a six feet tall body.  His face, far from
being flawlessly elegant, could best be described as 'homely.  ' But set above
the oversized nose, in the middle of the plain face, are two of the bleakest
eyes that ever graced a face, and in the shadow of his nose, his lips are curved
up into a wide and cunning grin.
~
