a &00&02grinchling&00~
A little green &00&02figure&00 is lurking here in the shadows.
~
   This creature is about three feet in height.  It is covered in splotches of
green matted hair.  It is definitely a humanoid type creature and has two arms
and two legs.  The arms end in hands with three massive claws that look very
sharp.  Its facial features are hidden behind green clumps of fur, except for a
wide grinning mouth full of razor sharp teeth.
~
