H M 0~
claus santa~
Mrs. Claus~
Mrs. Claus looks quite sad. Perhaps you should ask her what is wrong?
~
   A kind old lady stands before you.  She is of a very short stature, not more
than a few inches over four feet.  Her hair is snow white, but most of it is
covered up by a bright red stocking cap with white embroidered letters reading
"&14Mrs.  Claus&00".  Her face is amazingly smooth for her age and her rosy
cheeks only do more to enhance the image of a "kind grandmotherly" type figure.
She is wearing a bright red velvet dress, a pair of leather snow boots, and
white fluffy mittens.    
~
