E M 0~
elf helper magic santa 7613~
the elf~
A small elf in bright greens and reds smiles happily.
~
The most notable thing about the elf is that he is less than half the normal
height of a wood or high elf.  Other features are the same, from pointy ears
to the almond shaped eyes, yet elves rarely come shorter than 5'10.  The
second most notable thing about him is the dazzling array of colours in his
clothing.  His shoes are made of bright yellow cloth, with pointed ends
curling upwards.  He wears green and red striped socks, above which a pair
of blue trousers with bright yellow pockets meet a red and white striped
shirt, held down by blue suspenders.  Perched on his head is a jaunty green
peaked cap.
~
