grinch~
the &02Grinch&00~
&00&02A large green figure is here dressed like Santa Claus.&00
~
   The &02Grinch&00 is dressed up in a red and white suit that looks amazingly
like the one Santa Claus wears.  Its face is covered with green clumps of
greasy fur.  The fur is parted enough for two black beady eyes set upon a face
that has a permanent grimace.  A mouth full of rotten teeth teeters between a
sneer and an evil grin.  As you wonder what he is doing, you see the
&02Grinch&00 grabbing presents, stockings, and every manner of Christmas items
and stuffing them in a large red bag.    
~
